# Prices and measured usage behind the cost figures of the report.
# Date: 2026-11-21. Context: POC account us-east-1. Prices from the AWS Price List API, tokens from CloudWatch and from the job records, spend from Cost Explorer (data lags, 2026-11-21 is not in it yet).
# Each Cost Explorer query costs 0.01 USD.

### P1 Price of Nova Lite, on demand, us-east-1
$ aws pricing get-products --service-code AmazonBedrock --filters regionCode=us-east-1 model='Nova Lite'   (on demand input and output rows)
USE1-NovaLite-input-tokens | 0.0000600000 USD per 1K tokens | sku QRGWJ3P8FT28EYX2
USE1-NovaLite-output-tokens | 0.0002400000 USD per 1K tokens | sku CBZ6A6U7XK8WJ3KA
RESULT: Input 0.00006 USD and output 0.00024 USD per 1,000 tokens.

### P2 Price of Titan Text Embeddings V2, on demand, us-east-1
$ aws pricing get-products --service-code AmazonBedrock --filters regionCode=us-east-1 inferenceType='Input tokens'   (rows with TitanEmbeddingV2-Text)
USE1-TitanEmbeddingV2-Text-input-tokens | 0.0000200000 USD per 1K tokens | sku EDNQYEHQ3XQ8N7EY
USE1-TitanEmbeddingV2-Text-input-tokens-batch | 0.0000100000 USD per 1K tokens | sku K8BWWBWG2N3QMH5R
RESULT: 0.00002 USD per 1,000 input tokens (the batch price is half).

### P3 Bedrock metrics of the Nova Lite profile on 2026-11-21 (hours are local time, GMT-7)
$ aws cloudwatch get-metric-statistics --namespace AWS/Bedrock --metric-name <metric> --dimensions Name=ModelId,Value=us.amazon.nova-lite-v1:0 --period 3600 --statistics Sum
InputTokenCount: total 552528 | by hour [('11:00', 8), ('12:00', 552520)]
OutputTokenCount: total 23042 | by hour [('11:00', 3), ('12:00', 23039)]
Invocations: total 527 | by hour [('11:00', 1), ('12:00', 526)]
InvocationThrottles: total 0 | by hour []
InvocationClientErrors: total 0 | by hour []
InvocationServerErrors: total 0 | by hour []
RESULT: The totals equal the job records of the five jobs (input 552520, output 23039, 476 Fit calls plus 50 summary calls, see job-records.log) plus one test call of 11 tokens: input 552528 against 552520 plus 8, output 23042 against 23039 plus 3, 527 invocations against 526 plus 1. No throttle and no error.

### P4 November spend by service, to date
$ aws ce get-cost-and-usage --time-period Start=2026-11-01,End=2026-11-22 --granularity MONTHLY --metrics UnblendedCost --group-by Type=DIMENSION,Key=SERVICE
AWS Business Support+                       29.0000
Amazon Bedrock                               0.2487
AWS Cost Explorer                            0.0700
AWS Secrets Manager                          0.0313
Tax                                          0.0100
Amazon Simple Storage Service                0.0034
Amazon DynamoDB                              0.0006
Amazon API Gateway                           0.0000
total                                       29.3640
RESULT: AWS Business Support+ is 29.00 of the total. Bedrock is about 0.25. The five jobs of 2026-11-21 are not in these figures yet.

